message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "kakeya-small-fields: small Kakeya sets over small finite fields, exact values (K(3,4) = 28), bounds, proofs and tests"
abstract: "Small Kakeya sets over small finite fields. Exact smallest Kakeya sets by exhaustive, symmetry-reduced computer search: K(3,4) = 28, the smallest Kakeya set in F_4^3, so the even-q Kopparty-Saraf-Sudan construction is optimal there (k34/, with an independently written second search in k34b/). Also lim K(n,q)^(1/n) <= q * 2^(-(q-1)/q), sticky Kakeya constructions over F_3, and exhaustive scans of structured F_27 maps. Computer-assisted results, not checked by a human mathematician. Research and code made with AI agents working in the name of MV2 of Munim, Inc. Code licensed Apache-2.0; text and data CC BY 4.0 unless a file says otherwise."
